@title Machine options: the Option column reaches the generated page, the PDF and Excel Export all
@area Options
# The fixture's Cooling fan devices need the Cooling fan option. With the fan on, the Device list is added as a drawing page
# (picture shows the Option column on the sheet), then the PDF and Excel Export all are written (the PDF is checked as a file;
# the Excel file lands next to the opened project copy, so the unit test covers its columns).
open qa/fixtures/machine-options.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text option fan on
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Reports #2
wait 20
click_text "Device list"
wait 10
shot device-list
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Add report as drawing page
wait 4
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Schematic #1
wait 10
key PageDown
wait 3
key PageDown
wait 3
key PageDown
wait 3
key PageDown
wait 3
key PageDown
wait 6
shot generated-page
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Export PDF
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
expect_file ~/Documents/KoperCAD/*.pdf 2000
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Export all reports to Excel
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
shot after-exports
check_layout
